# standard.http — EAV-native binding to the SemanticScript HTTP runtime.
#
# Parity with the original semsc.py `standard.http` helper surface, expressed the
# EAV way: no http knowledge in the compiler. Each operation is a
# `body runtimeBinding ss_http_*` over the runtime shim (runtime/ss_http.c on
# SemanticScript/runtime/native_http/sem_http_runtime.c, whose optional h2o
# binding is off). The compiler lowers each op to an extern call; this module
# owns the typed contract (README ss11/ss26/ss34).
#
# This file binds the pure request/codec/session helpers (URL + HTML codecs,
# session expiry math, value probes, directory ensure) — the side-effect-light
# surface that an EAV handler composes. The socket server loop and the live
# request/response handler ABI are the next layer over the same runtime.

standardHttp is module
standardHttp path standard.http
standardHttp purpose "Typed EAV contract over the SemanticScript HTTP runtime via the ss_http_* ABI"
standardHttp invariant "Every operation is a runtimeBinding to an ss_http_* symbol; no http logic lives in the compiler"

HttpSafeUrl is alias
HttpSafeUrl for String
HttpSafeUrl purpose "A URL component validated safe for URL-bearing attributes (href/src/action)"

EpochMillis is alias
EpochMillis for Int64
EpochMillis purpose "A wall-clock timestamp in milliseconds since the Unix epoch"

urlEncode is operation
urlEncode in component String
urlEncode out String
urlEncode body runtimeBinding ss_http_url_encode_str
urlEncode purpose "Percent-encode one URL component (RFC 3986 unreserved pass through, space -> %20)"

urlDecode is operation
urlDecode in component String
urlDecode out String
urlDecode body runtimeBinding ss_http_url_decode_str
urlDecode purpose "Decode one URL component (+ -> space, %XX -> byte); inverse of urlEncode"

htmlEscape is operation
htmlEscape in text String
htmlEscape out String
htmlEscape body runtimeBinding ss_http_html_escape_str
htmlEscape purpose "Escape text for safe interpolation into HTML element/attribute content"

nowMillis is operation
nowMillis out EpochMillis
nowMillis body runtimeBinding ss_http_now_millis
nowMillis purpose "Current wall-clock time in milliseconds since the Unix epoch"

sessionExpiresAt is operation
sessionExpiresAt in nowMillis EpochMillis
sessionExpiresAt in ttlMillis Int64
sessionExpiresAt out EpochMillis
sessionExpiresAt body runtimeBinding ss_http_session_expires_at
sessionExpiresAt purpose "Compute a session expiry timestamp from the current time and a TTL"

sessionIsExpired is operation
sessionIsExpired in nowMillis EpochMillis
sessionIsExpired in expiresAtMillis EpochMillis
sessionIsExpired out Bool
sessionIsExpired body runtimeBinding ss_http_session_is_expired
sessionIsExpired purpose "Whether a session expiry timestamp has passed (1) or not (0)"

requestValueLength is operation
requestValueLength in value String
requestValueLength out Int64
requestValueLength body runtimeBinding ss_http_value_length
requestValueLength purpose "Byte length of a request value, treating a null pointer as length 0"

requestValueIsEmpty is operation
requestValueIsEmpty in value String
requestValueIsEmpty out Bool
requestValueIsEmpty body runtimeBinding ss_http_value_is_empty
requestValueIsEmpty purpose "Whether a request value is null or the empty string"

ensureDirectory is operation
ensureDirectory in directoryPath String
ensureDirectory out Int32
ensureDirectory body runtimeBinding ss_http_ensure_directory
ensureDirectory purpose "Create a directory if missing (parent must exist); returns 0 on success"

# --- server loop + request/response handler ABI (WS3-017) ---
# The blocking socket server (ss_http_server_run) is signal-shutdown-only, so it
# is driven from a real process, not a unit test; the handler ABI + response
# writer below lower + link into a native exe.

HttpHandler is operationType
HttpHandler in OpaquePointer
HttpHandler in OpaquePointer
HttpHandler out Int32
HttpHandler purpose "A request handler: (request, response) -> status int"

respond is operation
respond in response OpaquePointer
respond in status Int32
respond in body String
respond out Int32
respond body runtimeBinding ss_http_respond
respond purpose "Write a plaintext response body + status; returns the runtime status"

requestPath is operation
requestPath in request OpaquePointer
requestPath out String
requestPath body runtimeBinding ss_http_request_path
requestPath purpose "Read the request path from a live request"

serve is operation
serve in host String
serve in port Int32
serve in method String
serve in path String
serve in handler HttpHandler
serve out Int32
serve body runtimeBinding ss_http_serve
serve purpose "Run the blocking HTTP server for one route+handler (until SIGINT)"
